The '''Shady Ring''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Accessory]] that gives its user {{green|1%}} off on most shops. 

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
The '''Shady Ring''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Lucius}} for {{c|500,000}} after buying 1 item from the [[Dark Auction]].

If the player loses the item, it can be repurchased from {{NPCSprite|Rusty}} in the {{zone|Gold Mine}} for {{c|500,000}}.

